ROOT2FITs.py : 
    Convert the format of Significance map generated using Src_Main or TS map generated using Src_TSmap from root to fits
    python3 ROOT2FITs.py

ROOT2TXT.py  :
    Convert the format of Significance map generated using Src_Main or TS map generated using Src_TSmap from root to txt
    Content in generated .txt file: x:y:significance 
    python3 ROOT2TXT.py

SigMap_Eqm2Gal :
    Convert map from equatorial coordinate ro galactic coordinate

DrawSED.py :
    plot SED figure using the SED.txt generated by Src_Main and save to figures in .png and .pdf format
    display figures in .png format: display X.png

DrawSED_auto.py:
    plot SED figure
    Example : python3 DrawSED_auto.py --DirRes ../Results/Example1_Crab --ParRes ../Results/Example1_Crab/ParRes.yaml --srcname Crab 
